          "message": {
            "text": "A live script-specific answer precedes the static Playwright forScripts transcription, while an absent or unresolvable probe falls through unchanged. Keys use Blink’s LocaleToScriptCodeForFontSelection, so aliases such as ja and ja-JP address the same installed answer; focused unit coverage proves both resolve through the override.",
            "markdown": "A live script-specific answer precedes the static Playwright `forScripts` transcription, while an absent or unresolvable probe falls through unchanged. Keys use Blink’s `LocaleToScriptCodeForFontSelection`, so aliases such as `ja` and `ja-JP` address the same installed answer; focused unit coverage proves both resolve through the override."
          },
