            "text": "CSS family classification and table lookup use normalized lowercase names, but Blink passes the original AtomicString family spelling to MatchFontFamily. Preserve both forms in each stack entry; macos26 exposes the System-ui hidden alias only for the original platform query observed in Chrome, while generic recognition remains canonical and case-sensitive.",
            "markdown": "CSS family classification and table lookup use normalized lowercase names, but Blink passes the original AtomicString family spelling to MatchFontFamily. Preserve both forms in each stack entry; macos26 exposes the System-ui hidden alias only for the original platform query observed in Chrome, while generic recognition remains canonical and case-sensitive."
          },
