          "guid": "mspo1cvkz5c56c37",
          "message": {
            "text": "Memory trimming and host-font invalidation are different lifecycle events. Blink invalidation clears platform/font-data caches and notifies clients; Domotion now exposes a stronger environment invalidation that clears helper-derived installed/style/fallback answers and local() bindings while preserving downloaded webfont bytes and launched-browser generic preferences, which live above FontCache.",
            "markdown": "Memory trimming and host-font invalidation are different lifecycle events. Blink invalidation clears platform/font-data caches and notifies clients; Domotion now exposes a stronger environment invalidation that clears helper-derived installed/style/fallback answers and local() bindings while preserving downloaded webfont bytes and launched-browser generic preferences, which live above FontCache."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/render/font-resolution.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 8985,
                  "endLine": 9008,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": " *\n * This is the Domotion analogue of Blink `FontCache::Invalidate()`: use it\n * after an installed-font/fontconfig/preferences generation change. Unlike\n * `clearFontResolutionCaches()`, which is a correctness-neutral memory trim,\n * this also drops native-helper availability, installed-family/style/trait,\n * and platform-fallback answers so the next lookup observes the new host.\n * Downloaded webfont buffers remain intact. `local()` aliases are discarded:\n * their selected installed face is itself an environment-derived answer and\n * must be rediscovered by the capture session after invalidation.\n */\nexport function invalidateFontEnvironmentCaches(): void {\n  clearFontResolutionCaches();\n  clearGlyphHelperCache();\n  _clearHbFontCache();\n  _clearTrakStatCache();\n  dynamicSystemFontPaths.clear();\n  declaredFamilyForKey.clear();\n  win32SuffixDeclaredForKey.clear();\n  localFontAliasRegistry.clear();\n  darwinSystemUiPlatformCacheWarm = false;\n  sessionGenericFamilyOverrides = null;\n}\n\n/** Test-only sizes for the three platform primary-cut memos. */"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
            "tags": [
              "rationale"
            ],
            "ext-ai-tool-confidence": 0.93
          },
