          "guid": "msptkn4q1ptwk9ra",
          "message": {
            "text": "A Linux system-ui dynamic key must retain the browser-supplied sans nomination. Without it, the generic sysfb:* fast path treats Regular as final and skips per-run weight/style/stretch matching; the alternate DejaVu profile exposed 14,877 DejaVuSans-Bold → DejaVuSans mismatches. Retaining the nomination reduces the same 50,774-row slice to zero.",
            "markdown": "A Linux system-ui dynamic key must retain the browser-supplied `sans` nomination. Without it, the generic `sysfb:*` fast path treats Regular as final and skips per-run weight/style/stretch matching; the alternate DejaVu profile exposed 14,877 DejaVuSans-Bold → DejaVuSans mismatches. Retaining the nomination reduces the same 50,774-row slice to zero."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/render/font-resolution.ts"
