            "text": "The system-ui route follows the first effective family after unresolved aliases fall through. In -apple-system, system-ui, Blink reaches MatchSystemUIFont for the second token; retaining the raw-first-token rule left SFNS at its regular axis while labeling it weight 800.",
            "markdown": "The system-ui route follows the first effective family after unresolved aliases fall through. In `-apple-system, system-ui`, Blink reaches MatchSystemUIFont for the second token; retaining the raw-first-token rule left SFNS at its regular axis while labeling it weight 800."
          },
          "locations": [
